<title>MALAYSIA: Sungei Way, Sunway suspended.</title>
<headline>Sungei Way, Sunway suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of construction and leisure firms Sungei Way Holdings Bhd and Sunway Building Technology Bhd were suspended on the companies' request, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) official said.</p>
<p>He said the companies had separately requested for the suspension to make some announcements.</p>
<p>Analysts said they were not aware what the two companies were planning to announce. The two companies were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Sungei Way shares closed at 5.70 ringgit on Tuesday, while Sunway were last at 9.05 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
